{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "043P", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$G$", "MATH_0007": "$X/B$", "MATH_0008": "$a : G \\times_B X \\to X$", "MATH_0009": "$B$", "MATH_0010": "$T$", "MATH_0011": "$B$", "MATH_0012": "$a : G(T) \\times X(T) \\to X(T)$", "MATH_0013": "$G(T)$", "MATH_0014": "$X(T)$", "MATH_0015": "$X$", "MATH_0016": "$Y$", "MATH_0017": "$B$", "MATH_0018": "$G$", "MATH_0019": "$G$", "MATH_0020": "$\\psi : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0021": "$B$", "MATH_0022": "$T$", "MATH_0023": "$B$", "MATH_0024": "$\\psi : X(T) \\to Y(T)$", "MATH_0025": "$G(T)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-action-group-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ea06586e3c556d58c34ad7f8965c41c98f835b0c9b185b2a1c40011e23d0e3e3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f523e17f24a8330708a7997733af895476806705d0f0f3a8388cc98a40da5758", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a group algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0005>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> An <TEXTITOPEN_0001>action of <MATH_0006> on the algebraic space <MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is\na morphism <MATH_0008> over <MATH_0009> such that\nfor every scheme <MATH_0010> over <MATH_0011> the map <MATH_0012>\ndefines the structure of a <MATH_0013>-set on <MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0003> Suppose that <MATH_0015>, <MATH_0016> are algebraic spaces over <MATH_0017> each endowed\nwith an action of <MATH_0018>. An <TEXTITOPEN_0002>equivariant<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> or more precisely\na <TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0019>-equivariant<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> morphism <MATH_0020>\nis a morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0021> such\nthat for every <MATH_0022> over <MATH_0023> the map <MATH_0024> is\na morphism of <MATH_0025>-sets.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ee5e3301d3f0c09a98def070dc5610ea4f0315e0e4cdf959529292e8d5425a23", "unit_id": "tag:043Q:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "043P", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-action}\n\\xymatrix{\nG \\times_B G \\times_B X \\ar[r]_-{1_G \\times a} \\ar[d]_{m \\times 1_X} &\nG \\times_B X \\ar[d]^a \\\\\nG \\times_B X \\ar[r]^a & X\n}\n\\quad\n\\xymatrix{\nG \\times_B X \\ar[r]_-a & X \\\\\nX\\ar[u]^{e \\times 1_X} \\ar[ru]_{1_X}\n}\n\\end{equation}", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nG \\times_B X \\ar[r]_-{\\text{id} \\times f} \\ar[d]_a &\nG \\times_B Y \\ar[d]^a \\\\\nX \\ar[r]^f & Y\n}\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:96990ecf8b0977c0b1aae15128389dcedcb7ae988f569896fca23349d8558ab5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bc9db8203097d32c71f7dde81102a4f6f08add72473965072e6511740ee8b517", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn situation (1) this means that the diagrams\n<MATH_0001>\nare commutative. In situation (2) this just means that the diagram\n<MATH_0002>\ncommutes.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0baadee43669a4cb789043bf90b0734d98bfa5c109c3dece9104f7d5405dbb14", "unit_id": "tag:043P:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "043P", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$G \\to B$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to B$", "MATH_0004": "$a : G \\times_B X \\to X$", "MATH_0005": "$G$", "MATH_0006": "$X/B$", "MATH_0007": "$T$", "MATH_0008": "$B$", "MATH_0009": "$a : G(T) \\times X(T) \\to X(T)$", "MATH_0010": "$G(T)$", "MATH_0011": "$X(T)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-action-group-space}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-free-action}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e9c6bb04a70065e6f4eed7872b9a4801a50592f3229931ecfe6700098486b270", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3ff17cdfd7fc7a0b60ed543497beb81caf6c7cec006516824a94597a0d8964c8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002>, and <MATH_0003> as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an action of <MATH_0005> on <MATH_0006>.\nWe say the action is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>free<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every scheme <MATH_0007> over <MATH_0008>\nthe action <MATH_0009> is a free action of\nthe group <MATH_0010> on the set <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0166a55ba80e47faf9c1589bcbae2308f03d325431227908b1fb8ae5e14eba92", "unit_id": "tag:06P8:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "043P", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$a$", "MATH_0002": "$$\nG \\times_B X \\to X \\times_B X, \\quad (g, x) \\mapsto (a(g, x), x)\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-free-action}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-free-action}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5e52eda5d6c687db2cfa27a5637e4e1d87c5991d5b329465db25d03e2a3636aa", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:aff05aa006433180aed457942f8b4625bab5d0d657b0a2828c55b02805e525ad", "source_text": "Situation as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>,\nThe action <MATH_0001> is free if and only if\n<MATH_0002>\nis a monomorphism of algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:91866dd6d4f8a36142c2e19f56bba42ecc39af7a37773c2d664bec08bff671b3", "unit_id": "tag:06P9:statement"}
